        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Christian Slater, Mark Gordon, Graham Yost, Mikael Salomon, Peter Murnik\n- Works: Hard Rain, Interview with the Vampire, Broken Arrow, 1993 MTV Video Music Awards\n- Places: Gibson Amphitheatre, Los Angeles\n\nFacts:\n- In the 1990s, Christian Slater starred in big-budget films including Interview with the Vampire, Broken Arrow, and Hard Rain.\n- In 1993, Christian Slater hosted the MTV Video Music Awards at the Gibson Amphitheatre in Los Angeles.\n- Hard Rain is a 1998 action-thriller disaster film produced by Mark Gordon, written by Graham Yost, and directed by Mikael Salomon.\n- In 1998, Peter Murnik played Phil in the film Hard Rain.",
